      "id": "offers-feed-event",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Events:**\n- `onOfferSelect`: View supplier detail\n- `onCategoryFilter`: Filter by type\n- `onLocationFilter`: Filter by area\n- `onSearch`: Search offers\n- `onSaveOffer`: Bookmark offer\n- `onPullRefresh`: Reload offers",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "4"
    },
